---
title: Series collection
layout: home
description: A web series — seasons, episodes in order, and where the viewer got to. It is the video collection with one thing added: episodes are watched in sequence, so the number is navigation.
eyebrow: Collections · Series
source: src/components/commerce.css · video-card.css
---
<section class="im-section im-wrap" style="padding-top: 1.5rem; --im-section-gap: 1.5rem">
	<p class="im-eyebrow">Collections · Series · {{page.title}}</p>
	<p class="im-lede">{{page.description}}</p>
	<p class="doc-source"><code>{{page.source}}</code></p>
</section>

<div class="im-single im-wrap-wide" data-sidebar="on">
	<article class="im-stack" style="--im-stack-gap: 2rem">
		<header class="im-serieshero">
			<video poster="{{demo.six.[0].feature_image}}" muted loop playsinline autoplay preload="none" aria-hidden="true"></video>
			<div class="im-serieshero-copy">
				<p class="im-serieshero-meta"><span>Series</span><span>Season 1</span><span>4 episodes</span><span>Thursdays</span></p>
				<h1 class="im-serieshero-title">The Amalfi Road</h1>
				<p class="im-serieshero-text">Forty kilometres, two hours, and nobody in a hurry. Four films about one road, made over four days in November.</p>
				<p class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .5rem"><a class="im-btn im-btn-primary" href="/collections/series/episode/">{{icon "play"}}Start watching</a><button class="im-btn im-btn-ink" type="button">{{icon "bell"}}Notify me</button></p>
			</div>
		</header>

		<div class="im-collbar">
			<div class="im-collbar-filters" role="group" aria-label="Which season" data-im-filter="#eps">
				<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="all" aria-current="false">All</button>
				<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="s1" aria-current="page">Season 1</button>
				<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="s2" aria-current="false">Season 2</button>
				<button class="im-tag" type="button" value="extra" aria-current="false">Extras</button>
			</div>
			<div class="im-cluster" style="--im-cluster-gap: .375rem">
				<span class="im-caption">2 of 4 watched</span>
				<div class="im-progress" style="width: 7rem; --im-value: .5" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="50" aria-label="Watched"><span></span></div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="im-stack" id="eps" data-filter="s1" style="--im-stack-gap: 1.25rem">
			{{#each demo.episodes}}
			<div class="im-episode" data-state="{{state}}" data-facet="{{season}}">
				<span class="im-epnum">{{n}}</span>
				<article class="im-vidcard im-vidcard-row">
					<a class="im-vidcard-thumb im-thumb im-thumb-play" href="/collections/series/episode/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
						<img src="{{lookup ../demo.shots @index}}" alt="" loading="lazy">
						<span class="im-vidcard-time">{{time}}</span>
						{{#match state "=" "done"}}<span class="im-vidcard-progress"><span style="width: 100%"></span></span>{{/match}}
						{{#match state "=" "current"}}<span class="im-vidcard-progress"><span style="width: 34%"></span></span>{{/match}}
					</a>
					<div class="im-vidcard-body"><div>
						<h3 class="im-vidcard-title"><a href="/collections/series/episode/">{{title}}</a></h3>
						<p class="im-vidcard-meta"><span>{{when}}</span>{{#match state "=" "done"}}<span>Watched</span>{{/match}}{{#match state "=" "upcoming"}}<span>Not out yet</span>{{/match}}</p>
						<p class="im-vidcard-text">{{text}}</p>
					</div></div>
				</article>
			</div>
			{{/each}}
			<p class="im-feed-empty" data-facet-empty hidden>Nothing in this season yet.</p>
		</div>

		<section class="im-section" style="--im-section-gap: 1rem">
			<div class="home-head"><p class="im-caption" data-index="other">Other series</p><a class="im-card-cta" href="#other">All of them {{> "icons/arrow-right"}}</a></div>
			<div class="im-seriescards" id="other">
				{{#each demo.seriesall}}
				<article class="im-seriescard" data-state="{{#match state "=" "Running"}}running{{else}}finished{{/match}}">
					<span class="im-seriescard-media"><img src="{{lookup ../demo.shots @index}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
					<p><span class="im-kind" data-kind="series">{{icon "square-play"}}Series</span></p>
					<a class="im-seriescard-name" href="/collections/series/">{{name}}</a>
					<p class="im-seriescard-meta">
						<span class="im-seriescard-state">{{state}}</span>
						<span>{{parts}} parts</span>
						<span>{{when}}</span>
					</p>
					<p class="im-seriescard-text">{{text}}</p>
				</article>
				{{/each}}
			</div>
		</section>
	</article>

	<aside>
		<div class="im-sticky-rail">
		<div class="im-widgets">
			<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="rw-start">
				<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="rw-start">Start here</h2>
				<p class="im-widget-heading">Part one is the only one that assumes nothing.</p>
				<a class="im-btn im-btn-primary im-btn-sm" href="/collections/series/episode/">{{icon "play"}}Begin the series</a>
			</section>

			<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="rw-parts">
				<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="rw-parts">The parts</h2>
				<ol class="im-timeline im-timeline-detailed im-widget-series">
					{{#foreach demo.series}}
					<li class="im-timeline-item" data-state="{{#match @number "<" 3}}done{{else}}{{#match @number "=" 3}}current{{else}}{{/match}}{{/match}}">
						<span class="im-timeline-marker">{{@number}}</span>
						<h3 class="im-timeline-title">{{#match @number "=" 3}}<span>{{title}}</span>{{else}}<a href="/collections/series/episode/">{{title}}</a>{{/match}}</h3>
					</li>
					{{/foreach}}
				</ol>
			</section>

			<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="rw-other">
				<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="rw-other">Other series</h2>
				<div class="im-deck" data-im-deck>
					<div class="im-deck-stage">
						{{#each demo.seriesall}}{{#match @index ">" 0}}<a class="im-deck-card" href="/collections/series/" data-pos="{{#match @index "=" 1}}0{{else}}{{#match @index "=" 2}}1{{else}}2{{/match}}{{/match}}"><img src="{{lookup @root.demo.shots @index}}" alt="" loading="lazy"><b>{{name}}</b><small>{{parts}} parts · {{state}}</small></a>{{/match}}{{/each}}
					</div>
					<div class="im-deck-nav">
						<button class="im-btn im-btn-sm im-btn-icon" type="button" data-deck-prev aria-label="Previous">{{icon "chevron-left"}}</button>
						<button class="im-btn im-btn-sm im-btn-icon" type="button" data-deck-next aria-label="Next">{{icon "chevron-right"}}</button>
						<small><span data-deck-n>1</span> / 3</small>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="im-widget" aria-labelledby="rw-tools">
				<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="rw-tools">Made with <a href="/collections/uses/">Uses</a></h2>
				<div class="im-widget-products">
					<a class="im-widget-product" href="/collections/uses/page/"><span class="im-widget-product-mark">Pr</span><span class="im-widget-product-name">Premiere Pro</span><span class="im-widget-product-note">Edit</span>{{icon "arrow-right"}}</a>
					<a class="im-widget-product" href="/collections/uses/page/"><span class="im-widget-product-mark">Ae</span><span class="im-widget-product-name">After Effects</span><span class="im-widget-product-note">Titles</span>{{icon "arrow-right"}}</a>
					{{#each demo.uses}}{{#match group "=" "Camera"}}{{#match @index "<" 5}}<a class="im-widget-product" href="/collections/uses/page/"><img src="{{lookup @root.demo.shots @index}}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="im-widget-product-name">{{name}}</span><span class="im-widget-product-note">Shoot</span>{{icon "arrow-right"}}</a>{{/match}}{{/match}}{{/each}}
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="im-widget im-widget-fill" aria-labelledby="rw-sub">
				<h2 class="im-widget-title" id="rw-sub">Get the next part</h2>
				<p class="im-widget-heading">Emailed the morning it goes up.</p>
				{{> "components/subscribe" id="series-email" button="Follow"}}
			</section>
			<aside class="im-ad im-ad-rectangle" aria-label="Advertisement">
				<span class="im-ad-label">Sponsored</span>
				<span class="im-ad-slot"><img src="{{demo.shots.[5]}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></span>
				<button class="im-btn im-btn-sm im-ad-remove" type="button" popovertarget="ad-gate">{{icon "circle-x"}}Remove ads</button>
			</aside>
		</div>
		</div>
	</aside>
</div>

<section class="im-section im-wrap">
	<div class="im-prose">
		<h2>A series is a video collection that is in order</h2>
		<p>Everything here is the <a href="/collections/video/">video collection</a>'s: the channel head, the filter bar, the card. What a series adds is that the episodes have a <strong>sequence</strong>, and a viewer needs to know three things about it before they press anything — which one is first, which one they are on, and whether the last one is out yet.</p>
		<div class="im-table-scroll">
		<table>
			<thead><tr><th>Class</th><th></th></tr></thead>
			<tbody>
				<tr><td><code>im-episode</code></td><td>The row: a number, then the ordinary <a href="/collections/video/card/">video card</a> in its row layout.</td></tr>
				<tr><td><code>im-epnum</code></td><td>The number, in Geist Pixel, tabular. <code>data-state="done"</code> on the row turns it the success colour.</td></tr>
				<tr><td>The progress bar</td><td>The card's own <code>im-vidcard-progress</code> — full for a watched episode, part-way for the one in progress, absent for one not started.</td></tr>
				<tr><td>The season bar</td><td><code>im-collbar</code> with the seasons as chips and a <a href="/components/progress/">progress bar</a> showing how much of the season is done.</td></tr>
			</tbody>
		</table>
		</div>
		<p><strong>"Not out yet" is a state, not an absence.</strong> The fourth episode has no length and no still — it has a date. Hiding it would be easier and would lose the one viewer who came back to check.</p>

		<h2>In a theme</h2>
		{{{{code "hbs"}}}}
{{#get "posts" filter="tag:#series-amalfi" order="published_at asc" limit="all"}}
	{{#foreach posts}}
	<div class="im-episode" data-state="{{@custom.state}}">
		<span class="im-epnum">{{@number}}</span>
		{{> "components/video-card" layout="row"}}
	</div>
	{{/foreach}}
{{/get}}
		{{{{/code}}}}
		<p><code>order="published_at asc"</code> — a series is the one collection that is <strong>not</strong> newest-first. Getting that wrong is the single most common mistake on a series page, and it makes episode four the first thing a new viewer sees.</p>
	</div>
</section>
